==Description==
The '''Korblox Guard''' was an enemy that appeared in [[The Classic Event]]. It had higher health and faster speed than the [[Korblox Seeker (The Classic)|Korblox Seeker]].

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox Guard''' had blue skin. It wore a black shirt and pants, a blue helmet with grey outlines and blue neon spikes, and a red belt with a grey buckle. It wore an arm-pad and a knee-pad on its right arm and leg. There were also blue neon spikes on its right arm and leg. It did not have a left arm and leg, exposing its skeleton.

==Strategy==
*The [[Militant]] and [[Golden Soldier]] can be quite effective against the '''Korblox Guard'''.
*Towers like the [[Minigunner]], [[Engineer]] or [[Accelerator]] can be effective at clearing these out at later waves.

